1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,810
Writing, task two. E-mail number 16: Your visit.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:16,786
A friend from Ukraine wants to visit you in Czechia. Write him an e-mail of at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:26,623
Hi Denys,

4
00:00:26,933 --> 00:00:30,500
we are fine, our son goes to school and I have a new job.

5
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:33,247
Please come in August, I have holidays then.

6
00:00:33,533 --> 00:00:36,950
You can sleep in our living room, we have a big sofa.

7
00:00:37,233 --> 00:00:41,589
We'll go to Prague and Karlštejn Castle together, and we'll also go for a beer.

8
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:45,526
Bring comfortable shoes and a jacket, it gets cold in the evening.

9
00:00:45,833 --> 00:00:52,864
This e-mail has 56 words. One sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

10
00:00:53,567 --> 00:01:02,577
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
